              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ipapo mutumwa waJehovha akabuda akauraya varume zviuru zana namakumi masere nezvishanu pamusasa wavaAsiria. Vanhu vakati vachimuka mangwanani, onei mitumbi yavakafa!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.37.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.37.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
